# Exception: ship a pre-seeded snapshot so the repo runs after `git clone`
# without anyone having to obtain or unpack the hackathon dataset. The
# committed file contains only the public hackathon corpus
# (Immanuelkirchstr. 26). Local dev writes (uploads, agent learnings) land
# in the WAL file (still ignored above) until you `pragma wal_checkpoint`
# and re-commit on purpose.
!data/hausbuch.db

